        "on hardware-in-the-loop testing, and the Security agent on firmware signing and secure "
        "boot. AI assists embedded development by suggesting memory-optimized algorithms, "
        "generating peripheral initialization code from datasheets, and identifying timing "
        "issues in interrupt handlers. GitHub Copilot and Claude Code understand embedded C "
