        "transforms UI/UX design by generating layout variations from brief descriptions with "
        "tools like Figma AI and Framer, creating responsive component variants automatically, "
        "and suggesting accessibility improvements based on WCAG guidelines. Midjourney generates "
        "visual inspiration and conceptual explorations in seconds. Traditional designer hiring "
